            <ArticleTitle>[Electromyography and electroneurography in the follow-up study of carpal tunnel syndrome patients].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>144-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Electromyography is an useful method for the postoperative follow-up of carpal tunnel syndrome. In patients without sensory and motor signs EMG is able to differentiate those still suffering from subjective symptoms such as pain and paraesthesias.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
